<title>LITHUANIA: MAZEIKIU REFINES MORE OIL.</title>
<headline>MAZEIKIU REFINES MORE OIL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Mazeikiu oil refinery said on Thursday that it refined 2.188 million tonnes of crude in the first five months of the year compared to 1.128 million tonnes in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement it refined 583,000 tonnes of crude in the month of May itself.</p>
